# --- Generated model weights (194 MB) -------------------------------------
# Exported by scripts/export_onnx.py, and re-downloadable. Far too big for git,
# and nothing here is authored.
models/*
!models/README.md

# --- Vendored upstream checkout -------------------------------------------
# third_party/Video-Depth-Anything is a clone of someone else's repository,
# carrying its own .git and its own licence. It is cloned, not authored, so it
# is not ours to redistribute.
third_party/*
!third_party/README.md

# --- Media ----------------------------------------------------------------
